  "findings": [
    "The exact symmetric 16 + 24 inch station pattern gives a 25.5 inch central bay on north/south walls and 25 inch central bay on east/west walls.",
    "With the 18 inch ridge centered between y=115.5 and 133.5, east/west stations y=112 and 137 bracket the ridge. Therefore the unmodified station pattern yields 40 jack rafters and no common rafters. A central common pair would require an explicitly added or shifted station. No such member is invented here."
  ]
